<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the CREATURE_TYPE_COMBATANT or CREATURE_TYPE_NON_COMBATANT constant.
</p><p>Note that <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2da%20constants%20h" title="2da constants h">2da_constants_h</a> also defines a set of <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/CREATURE%20TYPE" title="CREATURE TYPE *">CREATURE_TYPE_*</a> constants. These are not returned by this function, only the CREATURE_TYPE_* constants defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a> apply here.
</p>
